    "catalogue_description": "The map looks really nice for 2010, a lot of thought was put into it. Other than a couple texture and geometry issues it\u2019s relatively issue free on the visual side. Gameplay wise, the zombies take forever to reach the windows, and even if you\u2019re outside the zombies will go through the windows, then loop back around to come to you. Not much else I can complain about though, just a good Nacht style map with good attention to detail. Strats: Train anywhere outside or camp with your back against the gate on the outside, the zombies to your right will run to the windows on the house then loop around and come to you clumping most of the zombies together.",
